As a treat on Black Friday, you can get 40% off a new annual individual JetBrains IDE or ReSharper subscription, or an upgrade to an annual individual All Products Pack or dotUltimate one.




A lot about development has changed, and your JetBrains IDE has changed with it. We recently introduced Air in IDEs, a new layer for agentic development. It lets you work with agents of your choice and use your own AI subscriptions and API keys. You can even try Junie Lite, a JetBrains coding agent, for free. 
JetBrains IDEs don’t just host agents; they equip them with IDE intelligence. Built-in skills and tools give supported agents access to the debugger in IntelliJ IDEA, a live Jupyter kernel in PyCharm, Chrome DevTools in WebStorm, database tools in DataGrip, dotTrace profiling in Rider, semantic code search, and more. And you stay in control, with diffs, navigation, and inspections that let you review and validate what your agents did without leaving the IDE you’re working in. 
With 40% off this Black Friday, it’s a good time to lock in your subscription for another year so you can keep building with the tools you rely on.
Simply use this code at checkout:
BF2026
If you’d prefer to take advantage of today’s price for a longer term, you can pay upfront for a two- or three-year subscription. The offer is valid November 25 – December 2, 2026.
To the Store

FAQ:
1. Which subscriptions are eligible for the Black Friday Deal?
This offer can be used for new annual individual subscriptions to JetBrains IDEs and ReSharper, as well as for upgrading your existing individual JetBrains IDE or ReSharper subscriptions to annual All Products Pack or dotUltimate ones. Except for continuity discounts, the offer cannot be combined with other discounts, promotions, or benefits. 
2. Will the discount be applied automatically, or do I need a promo code?
To apply the discount, use the promo code BF2026 at checkout. By applying the promo code, you agree to the JetBrains Promotional Codes Terms and Conditions.
3. Where can I enter the promo code?
At checkout, click Have a discount code? below the order section. Enter the promo code in the field and apply it.
4. Can I use the promo code more than once?
The promo code can be used only once.
5. Can the discount be applied to two- or three-year subscriptions?
The discount can also be applied when you buy a multi-year subscription.
6. Can I use the discount for a renewal?
The discount is available only for new annual subscriptions or upgrades to annual All Products Pack or dotUltimate ones. It does not apply to regular renewals.
7. Can I apply the discount to multiple subscriptions?
You can add several eligible subscriptions to the same cart. Enter the promo code once at checkout, and the discount will apply to all eligible subscriptions in the cart. The promo code can be used only once.

